BT /F2 16.0 Tf 72.00 720.00 Td (TIDE: Learning to Memorize at Test Time with) Tj ET
BT /F2 16.0 Tf 72.00 698.00 Td (Surprise-Gated Updates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 672.00 Td (Sofia Brandauer, Kwame Mensah, Lin Qiaoyu \(Northfield Lab for Machine Learning\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.0 Tf 72.00 642.00 Td (Abstract) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 622.00 Td (Attention is an excellent short-term memory but cannot scale to millions of tokens. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 609.00 Td (introduce TIDE, a neural long-term memory module that keeps learning while the model is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 596.00 Td (being used. The memory is a small multilayer perceptron whose weights are updated at test) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 583.00 Td (time by gradient descent on an associative loss, so that it memorizes the tokens that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 570.00 Td (surprise it most. TIDE reaches 71.3% accuracy on LongRecall at 16K tokens and scales to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 557.00 Td (inputs of two million tokens.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.0 Tf 72.00 537.00 Td (1 Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 517.00 Td (Models with a fixed state, such as linear attention, compress the past into a matrix and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 504.00 Td (lose detail as the context grows. Models with attention keep every token but pay for it in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 491.00 Td (memory. Test-time training offers a third option: treat memorization as learning, and let a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 478.00 Td (parametric memory adapt to each input as it streams by.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 458.00 Td (We take inspiration from human memory, where events that violate expectations are remembered) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 445.00 Td (better. In TIDE, surprise is the gradient of the associative loss with respect to the memory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 432.00 Td (parameters: a token whose value the memory predicts badly produces a large gradient and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 419.00 Td (changes the memory a lot, while an expected token leaves it almost untouched.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.0 Tf 72.00 399.00 Td (2 The Memory Module) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 379.00 Td (The memory M is a two-layer perceptron that maps keys to values. Each incoming token is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 366.00 Td (projected to a key k_t and a value v_t, and the memory is trained online to minimise the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 353.00 Td (reconstruction error of the pair:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 150.00 333.00 Td (loss\(M; x_t\) = || M\(k_t\) - v_t ||^2                            \(1\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 311.00 Td (A single gradient step per token would react only to the present token. Instead, momentum) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 298.00 Td (carries the surprise of earlier tokens, so that the tokens following a surprising event are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 285.00 Td (also memorized even when each of them looks unremarkable on its own. The update with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 272.00 Td (momentum eta_t and step size theta_t is:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 150.00 252.00 Td (U_t = eta_t U_{t-1} - theta_t grad loss\(M_{t-1}; x_t\)              \(2\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 150.00 230.00 Td (M_t = \(1 - a_t\) M_{t-1} + U_t                                  \(3\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 208.00 Td (Old information is removed by a data-dependent forgetting gate a_t in Equation \(3\). When the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 195.00 Td (input changes topic the gate approaches one and clears most of the memory; within a topic it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 182.00 Td (stays near zero. All three coefficients eta_t, theta_t and a_t are predicted from the token) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 169.00 Td (by small linear layers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.0 Tf 72.00 149.00 Td (3 Adding Memory to a Model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 129.00 Td (We compare memory as context, memory as gate and memory as layer. As context, the memory's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 116.00 Td (output for the current segment is prepended to the attention window. As a gate, the memory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 103.00 Td (and a sliding-window attention run in parallel and their outputs are mixed. As a layer, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 90.00 Td (memory is stacked in front of the attention blocks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 72.00 760.00 Td (Preprint. A synthetic paper written for the shodh-eval corpus.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 306.00 40.00 Td (1) Tj ET
